    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d792">

                <pb facs="1200" n="1186" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg1186"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Korea/4–3048: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Political Adviser in Korea</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jacobs</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-04-30">April 30, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>292. Cite Zpol 4558. After lengthy afternoon
                    session UNTCOK today adopted resolution of
                    which following is concluding paragraph (cannot get full text tonight).<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d792-f1"/>
                </p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“Resolved that it proceed from Seoul to Tokyo on 15 May 1948 for the purpose
                        of preparing its report on the work covered so far; that it returns to Seoul
                        during first week of June and that during the period of its absence, liaison
                        groups of its representatives remain in Seoul to receive all necessary
                        information”.</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacobs</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d792-f1" n="1" xml:id="d792-f1-content">
                <p>The remainder of the text was quoted in telegram 298, May 1, from Seoul, not
                    printed. The resolution was printed as doc. A/AC.19/69, April 30.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
